@startuml SD_UC_E1_3_Add_Order_Items
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14

actor "Nhân viên Phục vụ" as Waitstaff
boundary "Giao diện Web" as UI
control "OrderController" as Controller
participant "OrderService" as Service
participant "OrderRepository" as Repo
database "SQL Server" as DB

Waitstaff -> UI: Chọn thêm món & Cập nhật
activate UI

UI -> Controller: POST /api/orders/{id}/items
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: AddOrderItems(id, itemsDto)
activate Service

Service -> Repo: GetTableStatus(id)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: SELECT Tables.Status
activate DB
DB --> Repo: status
deactivate DB
Repo --> Service: status
deactivate Repo

alt Bàn đang Chờ thanh toán (PaymentPending)
    Service --> Controller: Result.Fail("Bàn đang chờ thanh toán")
    Controller --> UI: 409 Conflict
    UI --> Waitstaff: Khóa cập nhật, yêu cầu mở lại\ntrạng thái phục vụ
else Bàn đang phục vụ (Occupied)

Service -> Repo: InsertAdditionalItems(id, itemsDto)
activate Repo

Repo -> DB: INSERT OrderItems
activate DB
DB --> Repo: OK
deactivate DB

Repo --> Service: OK
deactivate Repo

Service -> UI: PushSignalR("Kitchen_AdditionalItems")

Service --> Controller: Result(Success)
Controller --> UI: 200 OK

UI --> Waitstaff: Cập nhật đơn hàng thành công
end
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate UI

@enduml
